"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,40)\">1Kgs 7:40</ref> read <bdbheb>הַסִּירוֺת</bdbheb> as v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:45\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,45)\">1Kgs 7:45</ref> and || <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,11)\">2Chr 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,16)\">2Chr 4:16</ref>, so Hebrew Manuscripts <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ke')\">Ke</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> and others) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>plat form</highlight> or <highlight>stage</highlight> of bronze (probably round, bowl-like in shape) on which, according to Chronicles, Solomon stood and kneeled <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,13)\">2Chr 6:13</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Kgs 7:38", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:30", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "1Sam 2:14", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Exod 30:18", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 30, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:40", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "2Chr 4:14", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:43", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 43}, {"raw": "2Chr 4:6", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Zech 12:6", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Exod 30:28", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 30, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Exod 31:9", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 31, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Exod 35:16", "book": "EX